t/pull/106572.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-19T21:34:03Z"},"body":"This PR fixes a loading error (\"Unrecognized or unsupported color layout in DDS\") of uncompressed, opaque DDS files that have been saved with padding to align the data to 32bits.\r\n\r\nThis happens for the following flags:\r\n`DDPF_RGB` flag is 1 (data is uncompressed)\r\n`DDPF_ALPHAPIXELS` flag is 0 (texture has no alpha channel)\r\n`RGBBitCount` field is 32 (24bit for RGB channels, 8bit unused)\r\n\r\nThis fix loads the data as if it was RGBA8/BGRA8 and then removes the alpha channel to create RGB8/BGR8 data.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106572/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106572/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}